"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Developed as the seventh installment of "The Real Housewives" franchise, following "The Real Housewives of Orange County", "New York City", "Atlanta", "New Jersey", "D.C.", and "Beverly Hills", it aired three seasons and focused on the personal and professional lives of several women living in Miami, Florida.","title":"The Real Housewives of Miami"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" In 2016, executive producer Andy Cohen confirmed the series had been cancelled.","title":"The Real Housewives of Miami"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The twelfth season of "The Real Housewives of Orange County", an American reality television series, is broadcast on Bravo.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 12)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It premiered on July 10, 2017, and is primarily filmed in Orange County, California.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 12)"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Its executive producers are Adam Karpel, Alex Baskin, Douglas Ross, Gregory Stewart, Scott Dunlop, Stephanie Boyriven and Andy Cohen.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 12)"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The ninth season of "The Real Housewives of Orange County", an American reality television series, was broadcast on Bravo.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 9)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It aired from April 14, 2014 until September 8, 2014, and was primarily filmed in Orange County, California.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 9)"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Its executive producers were Adam Karpel, Alex Baskin, Douglas Ross, Gregory Stewart, Scott Dunlop, Stephanie Boyriven and Andy Cohen.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 9)"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The eighth season of "The Real Housewives of Orange County", an American reality television series, was broadcast on Bravo.","title":"The Real Housewives of Orange County (season 8)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It aired f